Hi Rachel,

I can understand your frustrations. I've been having many similar issues. Am finding ways to work around them, for now at least.

I had the same error when trying to run gl.filter.secondaries(gl, method = "best"), but I don't get the error when using method = "random" (the default). It seems reasonable, to me at least, to use that at least for the time being. Otherwise if you install the current development version of dartR that may fix this error but you may have other issues with other package dependencies.

Good luck.

Peter K

